<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογλωσσ-ίς</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογλωσσ-ττίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swelling on the under side of the
				tongue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the under surface of the tongue,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
			<i>chaplet</i> (prob. made from the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόγλωσσον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> pl.,
				<i>cough lozenges,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
